#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/introduction_to_python_scripting.rst:179
msgid ""
"To get Python scripting working on Windows 7/8/8.1, you will need to install t"
"he `Universal C Runtime from Microsoft's website <https://www.microsoft.com/en"
"-us/download/details.aspx?id=48234>`_. (Windows 10 already comes with it.)"
msgstr ""
